	"spell.arcane_spells.arcane_bolt": "Arcane Bolt",
	"spell.arcane_spells.arcane_bolt.description": "Hold to charge, release to fire a bolt that explodes on impact. At full charge it also bursts into shards that seek out those nearby.",
	"spell.arcane_spells.chain_lightning": "Chain Lightning",
	"spell.arcane_spells.chain_lightning.description": "Strikes the creature you aim at, then leaps between others nearby, weakening with each jump. Leaps with nowhere to go discharge round the last one struck.",
	"spell.arcane_spells.blink": "Blink",
	"spell.arcane_spells.blink.description": "Teleport a short distance in the direction you look. The afterimage you leave behind bursts a moment later.",
	"spell.arcane_spells.arcane_ward": "Arcane Ward",
	"spell.arcane_spells.arcane_ward.description": "A shell of runes that absorbs hits and turns projectiles back on their shooter. Broken, it bursts outwards.",
	"spell.arcane_spells.frost_nova": "Frost Nova",
	"spell.arcane_spells.frost_nova.description": "A burst of cold that damages, slows and freezes everything around you, freezes still water and puts out fire.",
	"spell.arcane_spells.celestial_judgment": "Celestial Judgment",
	"spell.arcane_spells.celestial_judgment.description": "Channel until the circle closes, then release: a pillar of starlight bores into the marked ground and detonates. The undead suffer most.",
	"spell.arcane_spells.meteor_swarm": "Meteor Swarm",
	"spell.arcane_spells.meteor_swarm.description": "Channel, then release: a burning sigil opens over the marked ground and rains meteors across it, half of them seeking out creatures.",
	"spell.arcane_spells.singularity": "Singularity",
	"spell.arcane_spells.singularity.description": "Channel, then release: a black hole drags in everything nearby, devours the ground and grows as it feeds, bends the light round it, then collapses, the harder the bigger it grew, throwing back what it held.",
	"spell.arcane_spells.chrono_field": "Chrono Field",
	"spell.arcane_spells.chrono_field.description": "Channel, then release: time stops in a dome around you. Blows struck inside it land at once, harder, when it ends, and projectiles fly back the way they came.",
	"spell.arcane_spells.astral_gate": "Astral Gate",
	"spell.arcane_spells.astral_gate.description": "Channel, then release: step through a gate to the place you marked, far away, or look straight up to gate home. Both ends stay open for anyone, and quicken whoever comes through.",
	"spell.arcane_spells.planetfall": "Planetfall",
	"spell.arcane_spells.planetfall.description": "Channel, then release: the sky tears open, gravity fails, and a burning world falls out of the rift onto the marked ground, leaving its ore-rich core in the crater.",
